This directory contains scripts which demonstrate the efficient
global and relative phase equivalence checking functions.  These
functions also compute the phase factors.

Scripts
-------

gp_grover_state.qpro: Applies a single Grover iteration to a state
                      and creates a copy of its state vector that
                      differs by a global phase.  The equivalence
                      of the two states up to global phase is
                      checked and the phase factor computed.

hamiltonian.qpro: Creates a quantum circuit that simulates a 
                  Hamiltonian consisting of Pauli operators.
                  A Hamiltonian that differs by this Hamiltonian
                  only in the time step is also created.  The
                  equivalence of the two operators up to global
                  phase is checked and the phase factors computed.

